Call site of decode inside filerepo.Get: the callee's set without the caller's &CorruptError{Err: err} wrapper.
Expect sentinel errShortRecord bare, and strconv.ErrSyntax / strconv.ErrRange (plus ParseInt's opaque base /
bit-size errors) behind (*strconv.NumError).Unwrap + "balance: %w" (ParseInt) or "status: %w" (Atoi); no
(*CorruptError).Unwrap link and no os origin. The error of the third ParseInt (spent) is discarded.
(internal/strconv.Error entries: see parse_amount_decl.)
